Subject: [PATCH 87/91] Incursion acceleration gates point at their pocket

Incursion gates were plain celestials, so the client drew them facing a
default direction and never showed them as active. They're now
acceleration gate entities with dunDirection set to the line towards the
pocket they lead to, and dunOpenUntil set once the gate is unlocked.
Unlocking a gate sends the slim item update so it lights up in place.
---
 .../system/cosmicMgrs/DungeonMgr.cpp          |  8 +++-
 src/eve-server/system/cosmicMgrs/DungeonMgr.h |  3 +-
 .../system/cosmicMgrs/IncursionMgr.h          |  6 ++-
 .../system/cosmicMgrs/IncursionSites.cpp      | 46 ++++++++++++++++---
 4 files changed, 54 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

